    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> and <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> be two functions defined for <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Define the following sets whose elements are written in the increasing order:<br /><math><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />List- <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> contains the sets <math><mi>X</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;